This repository is a fork of the `prp-core` plugin from
https://github.com/Wirasm/PRPs-agentic-eng, forked at commit
2cced43d4dc9e95206155454e2729aef956ebe22 (2026-09-01).

The original work is Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Rasmus Widing and is licensed under
the MIT License, reproduced in LICENSE. Modifications made in this repository are
Copyright (c) 2026 NanoBoom and are released under the same license.

Changes from upstream at the time of the fork:

- The repository root is the plugin, rather than the plugin living under
  `plugins/prp-core/` in a larger repository.
- Skills moved from `skills/<name>/` to the `skills/prp-core/` bucket, and the
  `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}` paths inside `prp-loop` and `prp-worktree` were updated
  to match.
- `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` and `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` were
  rewritten for this repository, and `skills.sh.json` was added.
- The skills, agents, and hook themselves are unmodified.

Third-party material adapted after the fork:

- `skills/prp-core/response-policy/references/chinese.md` adapts rules and
  samples from https://github.com/Fenng/Tech-Doc-Style-Chinese
  (`references/controlled-technical-chinese.md` and
  `references/terminology-and-typography.md`), Copyright (c) 2026 Fenng,
  licensed under the MIT License.
- The sentence limits and the light-verb and `的` checks in the same skill
  follow https://github.com/QingYunA/answer-me-with-html
  (`src/lint/ste.js`), Copyright (c) 2026 Answer me with HTML contributors,
  licensed under the MIT License.

Both licenses grant permission on the terms reproduced in LICENSE.
